This image is from the Roblox game Sonic Speed Simulator. 
The characters shown are skins from the game's Halloween event. From left to right, they are Vampire Shadow, Vampire Sonic, and Vampire Silver.
Vampire Silver was a premium reward in the Season 13 Fast Pass.
The Halloween event requires players to complete quests to unlock new skins and items.
The background appears to be the entrance to a spooky castle, which is likely part of the Halloween event map.
